# ---- Experiment outputs ----
# Raw run outputs are large and regenerable from configs + seeds.
# They are NOT committed; reproducibility comes from configs, seeds, code version,
# and the commands recorded in docs/research_log.md.
results/**
!results/.gitkeep
!results/README.md

# Committed exception: small, final, paper-backing summary artifacts may be added
# explicitly with `git add -f` and must be regenerable by a logged command.

# Scratch
scratch/
tmp/
*.log

